  "description": "MCP in BOTH directions. Exposes a Model Context Protocol server's tools as Lyntai ITools so the tool loop can call them, and hosts the app's registered ITools as an ephemeral, localhost-only MCP server for a CLI that runs its own agent loop. Wired via builder.AddMcpTools(...) and builder.AddMcpToolHost(...). Absorbed Lyntai.Tools.Mcp.Hosting, which pinned the same dependency and is retired.",
